    "text": "If <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math><mn>375</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math> is equal to:",
